### 1. Créer un client
POST http://localhost:8080/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Trabelsi",
  "prenom": "Mohamed Amine",
  "email": "amine@example.com",
  "telephone": "12345678",
  "numPermis": "P123456",
  "dateInscription": "2026-01-15"
}

### 2. Lister tous les clients
GET http://localhost:8080/client

### 3. Récupérer le client par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/client/1

### 4. Créer un véhicule
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "AB-123-CD",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Clio",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 45.50,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE"
}

### 5. Lister tous les véhicules
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicule